<title>ITALY: Italy cuts discount rate to 7.5 pct from 8.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy cuts discount rate to 7.5 pct from 8.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said on Wednesday that it would cut the official discount rate to 7.5 percent from 8.25 percent, effective from Thursday.</p>
<p>The last change to the discount rate was on July 23, when it was reduced by 75 basis points.</p>
</text>
